WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.360
"I was angry with my friend:" He says so,

2
00:00:03.410 --> 00:00:05.150
and the anger is gone.

3
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:09.500
"I was angry with my foe:"
This time he says nothing.

4
00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:12.660
"I told it not, my wrath did grow."

5
00:00:12.710 --> 00:00:14.870
The anger goes into the ground.

6
00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:16.490
A seedling sprouts.

7
00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:21.380
Day and night, it grows into a
dark tree with one shining apple.

8
00:00:21.430 --> 00:00:25.420
Then, in the dark, a shadowy
figure creeps towards it.

9
00:00:25.470 --> 00:00:27.440
So who ends up poisoned?

10
00:00:27.490 --> 00:00:31.800
In this mission, you'll compare anger
that's told with anger that's hidden.

11
00:00:31.850 --> 00:00:34.100
You'll watch the anger grow like a plant,

12
00:00:34.150 --> 00:00:36.870
fed and tended stage by stage.

13
00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:39.750
And you'll meet the bright
apple that tempts the foe.

14
00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:41.760
What old story does it echo?

15
00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:44.930
Your mission: work out
who ends up poisoned.
